  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "\"Standout Amenities of this Spacious Beach Retreat:<br><br>* 5 bedroom/5.5 bathroom home on the south side of 30A<br><br>* Two community pools and a quick 2-minute walk to deeded beach access<br><br>* Multiple private balconies and porches with outdoor seating<br><br>* Newly remodeled kitchen with walk-in pantry and new appliances<br><br>* Smart TVs in every bedroom and full-size washer/dryer<br><br>* Ideal layout for multi-family vacations or group stays<br><br>​​​​​​​*Parking for 2 cars <br><br>* Professionally Managed<br><br>* This property is not available to adults under the age of 25. *<br><br>Top of the Dunes is a newly remodeled 5-bedroom, 5.5-bathroom beach home located just a two-minute walk from the white sands of 30A. With fresh paint, new furniture, updated appliances, and a beautifully renovated kitchen, this spacious multi-level retreat comfortably sleeps 15. The bedding includes a King suite, two Queen bedrooms, a double bunk room, a bunk bed with trundle, and a sleeper sofa—perfect for large families or multiple couples traveling together.<br><br>The first floor offers a welcoming living area, two guest rooms, a sleeper sofa, and a full-size washer and dryer. On the second floor, you'll find the main living room, dining area, kitchen with walk-in pantry, and the King suite. The third floor features a Queen room with a private deck and a double bunk room. Each bedroom has its own en-suite bathroom and smart TV for added comfort. With private decks on every level and an outdoor patio with a gas grill, Top of the Dunes is designed for relaxing, entertaining, and soaking in the coastal breeze.<br><br>About the Neighborhood:<br>Located on the south side of 30A in Seagrove Beach, Top of the Dunes offers easy access to two community pools, scenic bike paths, and multiple beach entrances. You're just a short walk from great restaurants, shopping, and outdoor activities. This central 30A location places you minutes from Seaside, Eastern Lake, and other popular Gulf Coast spots—making it a prime destination for families and groups looking to enjoy everything 30A has to offer.<br><br>Bedding Setup:<br>First Floor:<br>Guest Bedroom 1: Queen Bed<br>Guest Bedroom 2: Bunk Bed with Trundle<br>Living Area: Sleeper Sofa<br><br>Second Floor:<br>Primary Bedroom: King Bed<br><br>Third Floor:<br>Guest Bedroom 3: Queen Bed (Private Deck)<br>Guest Bedroom 4: Double Bunk Beds (2 Twin-over-Twin)<br><br>Key Features of Seagrove Beach and 30A<br><br>Beaches: Powdery white sands and crystal-clear waters make for perfect beach days.<br><br>Outdoor Activities: Bike trails, coastal dune lakes, paddleboarding, and nature reserves await exploration.<br><br>Dining and Shopping: Enjoy local cuisine and boutique shopping along 30A.<br><br>Family-Friendly Vibe: A relaxed atmosphere with options for all ages, from beach fun to art galleries.<br>\"",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Top of the Dunes | Spacious 5BR Home | Walk to Beach + Gas Grill + Pools"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
